        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a legend in an idle RPG where the fight never ends and the loot is infinite. Slay thousands of monsters, collect legendary gear, and grow infinitely powerful with gem crafting and prestige systems. Your hero fights for you 24/7, so your progress never stops.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.poster.avif?t=1762756363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.webm?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.mp4?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of strategy, not just clicks. Every piece of gear matters, with procedurally generated stats and powerful legendary effects.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.poster.avif?t=1762756363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.webm?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.mp4?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for greatness by crafting mighty gems, but be warned—failure could shatter them to dust. Customize your hero's stats, create specialized equipment loadouts, and gather an army of companions to conquer the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top, then Prestige to absorb your power into permanent bonuses, making you stronger with every new journey. Take on special bounties from the Hunter's Board for unique rewards and upgrades. Your adventure is endless, and your power has no limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cult... I mean, community!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a legend in an idle RPG where the fight never ends and the loot is infinite. Slay thousands of monsters, collect legendary gear, and grow infinitely powerful with gem crafting and prestige systems. Your hero fights for you 24/7, so your progress never stops.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.poster.avif?t=1762756363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.webm?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/5b39c69fc6864d648fc947e9ab068167.mp4?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of strategy, not just clicks. Every piece of gear matters, with procedurally generated stats and powerful legendary effects.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.poster.avif?t=1762756363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.webm?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118640/extras/adb2a6ba980be6b43f36a61b21adb2e5.mp4?t=1762756363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for greatness by crafting mighty gems, but be warned—failure could shatter them to dust. Customize your hero's stats, create specialized equipment loadouts, and gather an army of companions to conquer the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top, then Prestige to absorb your power into permanent bonuses, making you stronger with every new journey. Take on special bounties from the Hunter's Board for unique rewards and upgrades. Your adventure is endless, and your power has no limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cult... I mean, community!</p>",
        "short_description": "Slay endless monsters for legendary loot. Master deep crafting and prestige systems to grow infinitely. Collect an army of companions and conquer the unknown. Do you have what it takes to become a hero?",
